    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Post Title Required plugin purpose to make title require field and limit its character.</p>\n<h3>Release</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Initial release 1.0.0</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>License</h3>\n<p>This plugin is licensed under the GPLv2 or later. For more information, see https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin files to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/post-title-required</code> directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; screen in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Navigate to the settings &gt; WP Required Post Title or link  <code>/wp-admin/options-general.php?page=post-title-required</code> to the pugin setting page</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='can%20we%20apply%20to%20particular%20post%20type%3F'>\nCan we apply to particular post type?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, we can apply to only selected post type.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with WordPress 6.9.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatible with WordPress 6.8.2.</li>\n<li>Added option to ignore invisible title characters (e.g., soft hyphens, zero-width spaces).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility update for WordPress 6.8.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
